- installation of Microservices in BE (SPRING BOOT)
 MS etudiant:
  - independance: (config client[to get config from config server], Eureka Discovery client)
 MS config: 
  - independance: (config server[to provide configuration to config clients], Eureka Discovery server)
 MS eureka (to register and discover microservices):
  - independance: (Eureka Discovery server[to register and discover microservices], config client)
MS gateway (to route requests to appropriate microservices): just like localhost/8080/etudiants
  - independance: (Reactive Gateway, config client[to get config from config server], Eureka Discovery client)


if we want to make MS communicate with each other, we have to use HTTPInterface (REST API) by adding reactive web dependency in each microservice that needs to communicate with others.